{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"28038","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v60933","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c39857","characterName":"千原 直人","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"37758","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"153207"},{"characterId":"37758","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"188512"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7889"],"vndbCharacterId":"c39857"},"originalCharacterName":"千原 直人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本有数の財閥、天城家のお屋敷で働くセカンドシェフ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その中でも、お菓子作りはプロ級の腕前を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃、お屋敷で働く義母に養子として引き取られ、義理の父母、妹に囲まれ、血の繋がった家族のように愛情を持って育てられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日奥様に呼び出され、舞城女学園に赴任する事になったのだが、女装して通うという事は知らされておらず困惑するも、責任感の強さから受け入れる事に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千弘として学園に通うことになったのは、上司の八雲と奥様しか知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家族も知らない……というか、恥ずかしくて言えない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7889","sourceWorkId":"22812","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本有数の財閥·天城家のお屋敷で働くセカンドシェフ。 お菓子作りはプロ級の腕前。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃、お屋敷で働く義母に養子として引き取られ、義理の父母、妹に囲まれ、血の繋がった家族のように愛情を持って育てられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日奥様に呼び出され、舞城女学園へ女装して赴任することに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千弘として学園に通うことになったのは、上司の八雲と奥様しか知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家族も知らない……というか、恥ずかしくて言えない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ほ、本当に女装して、ばれたりしないんですかっ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37758"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9dd1063e448f0e8e7f5aee440d1045143159bf48260d6e36da36018bc0c4b3d3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb59c7299a851135cd86f412edba71f69a0ae3cfc258e1c0cd14dd73aac4b071.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c41537","characterName":"飛鳥 湊","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"38475","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"143834"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8273"],"vndbCharacterId":"c41537"},"originalCharacterName":"飛鳥 湊","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"522"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this game! Left without anyone to rely on after the passing of his grandmother, he was taken in by Kazari and offered a roof over his head, as well as enrollment at her family’s all-girls school. Despite very much being a boy, when dolled up in a skirt he can easily pass for the fairer sex – even without the extra padding. While this god-given talent might help him move through his new school life undetected, he’s still loathe to accept how good a girl he makes..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His hobbies and talents include cooking, cleaning, laundry, and other household chores. In fact, upon moving into the girls’ dorms, he assumed all domestic chore duties himself because he couldn’t bear to see the mess his housemother-less dormmates had made. For his troubles he was later voted \"no. 1 ideal housewife\" in a campus newspaper club poll."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Johren"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41537"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"唯一の身寄りである祖母を亡くして、天涯孤独の身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"行くあてもなく困っていたところに現れた風莉に拾われ、女子校に通うことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男の子だが、女装してスカートを穿くと胸を盛ったりしなくても全く違和感がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その美少女っぷりは正体を隠すのには好都合だが、本人的には納得がいかないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味と特技は、料理や掃除洗濯など家事全般。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ越し先の寮では、寮母もいない雑な生活を見かねて家事の一切を取り仕切ることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"後に新聞部のアンケート企画で『素敵なお嫁さんになれそうな子Ｎｏ．１』に選ばれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8273","sourceWorkId":"22476","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主角。唯一的依靠──祖母过世后便无依无靠。走投无路的他被风莉收留，于是开始在女校上学。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然是男孩子，但只要穿上女装和裙子，也丝毫没有违和感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他的美少女外表正适合用来隐藏身分，但他本人似乎不太能接受。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兴趣与擅长的事物是下厨、打扫、洗衣等所有家务。搬进宿舍后，因为看不惯其中杂乱的生活，所以担起了所有家务。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"之后在新闻社的问卷企划中被选为「感觉会是完美新娘的女孩子No.1」。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38475"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/4615b78913a3ce56cbc4cc107dcb93c2bba17be999ad3a2c7cc6b41d0ecbcdb2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd5017d1d55256569ace63cd04dde47acb2afdf06b4d6143e0ddb9c6949cc008.webp","width":86,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:2612","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2612","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:2612","name":"ensemble","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-review","relationId":"egs:work-brand:28038:2612","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p20417","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p20417","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p20417","name":"dodjjdba1","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:174002:v60933","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p628","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p628","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p628","name":"ensemble","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:77235:v60933","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
